ABILITY:Weapon Training II|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Drill Sergeant ~ Greater Tactician|TYPE:Fighter Class Feature.ArchetypeAbility.SpecialQuality.Extraordinary.WeaponTraining2|DESC:The drill sergeant gains the cavalier's greater tactician class feature. The drill sergeant receives an additional teamwork feat as a bonus feat. He must meet the prerequisites for this feat. The drill sergeant can grant this feat to his allies using the tactician ability. Using the tactician ability is a swift action.
USERPOOL:Weapon Training II|POOLPOINTS:0.0
ABILITY:Weapon Training III|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Advanced Weapon Training ~ Combat Competence|TYPE:WeaponTraining.Advanced Weapon Training.WeaponTraining2.WeaponTraining3.WeaponTraining4.SpecialQuality.Extraordinary|DESC:The fighter gains an item mastery feat as a bonus feat, which functions with any magic weapon he wields, even if the magic weapon does not meet the feat's normal requirements. He must meet all of the feat's prerequisites.
USERPOOL:Weapon Training III|POOLPOINTS:0.0
ABILITY:Weapon Training IV|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Drill Sergeant ~ Master Tactician|TYPE:Fighter Class Feature.ArchetypeAbility.SpecialQuality.Extraordinary.WeaponTraining4|DESC:The drill sergeant gains the cavalier's master tactician class feature. The drill sergeant receives an additional teamwork feat as a bonus feat. He must meet the prerequisites for this feat. The drill sergeant can grant this feat to his allies using the tactician ability. Whenever the drill sergeant uses the tactician ability, he grants any two teamwork feats that he knows. He can select from any of his teamwork feats, not just his bonus feats.
USERPOOL:Weapon Training IV|POOLPOINTS:0.0

